{"4013110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Paws VS Paws", "steam_appid": 4013110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/89e1f83f7e6f88953e5d4e2ddbb6157d.avif?t=1788077945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras_big/89e1f83f7e6f88953e5d4e2ddbb6157d.webp?t=1788077945 width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s time for revenge! Lead the army of dogs to victory in this strategic Tower Defense where managing your towers will be essential. Rebuild the Village to unlock and upgrade ever more powerful turrets! Are you up to the challenge that awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Analyze the map and place your defense towers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/3cbbed9028ac75a7595debd01f208999.poster.avif?t=1788077945\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/3cbbed9028ac75a7595debd01f208999.webm?t=1788077945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/3cbbed9028ac75a7595debd01f208999.mp4?t=1788077945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of enemy cats and defend yourself by building increasingly crazy defense towers, all operated by strong-willed dogs! Be strategic in your placement, or you’ll quickly be overwhelmed by the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your money wisely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/8191e716b61001f7513640f2e7219013.poster.avif?t=1788077945\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/8191e716b61001f7513640f2e7219013.webm?t=1788077945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/8191e716b61001f7513640f2e7219013.mp4?t=1788077945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating your enemies will earn you money to build more towers or upgrade existing ones, but it may be wiser to save for the long term... The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/df9cd5d052990bf46c6f829e7ab21d04.avif?t=1788077945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras_big/df9cd5d052990bf46c6f829e7ab21d04.webp?t=1788077945 width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade the village and your towers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/fb286164afe845cf89160ca07a8dd835.poster.avif?t=1788077945\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/fb286164afe845cf89160ca07a8dd835.webm?t=1788077945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/fb286164afe845cf89160ca07a8dd835.mp4?t=1788077945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn as much money as possible to rebuild your village, unlock new towers with surprising powers, and upgrade them to fend off the mighty tanks of the cat army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save all your friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/9363c354afa988f96a337841e40877f0.poster.avif?t=1788077945\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/9363c354afa988f96a337841e40877f0.webm?t=1788077945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/9363c354afa988f96a337841e40877f0.mp4?t=1788077945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every level you win, a new resident will join your village! Save them all and discover who they are through their profile cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/17ba0f0ee0a39dcf4b66ae6f2db1e32c.avif?t=1788077945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras_big/17ba0f0ee0a39dcf4b66ae6f2db1e32c.webp?t=1788077945 width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different environments for varied fun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 35 levels to put you to the test! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful graphics and charming characters! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully translated into 9 languages </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the dogs! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-save to avoid losing progress!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/89e1f83f7e6f88953e5d4e2ddbb6157d.avif?t=1788077945\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras_big/89e1f83f7e6f88953e5d4e2ddbb6157d.webp?t=1788077945 width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s time for revenge! Lead the army of dogs to victory in this strategic Tower Defense where managing your towers will be essential. Rebuild the Village to unlock and upgrade ever more powerful turrets! Are you up to the challenge that awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Analyze the map and place your defense towers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/3cbbed9028ac75a7595debd01f208999.poster.avif?t=1788077945\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/3cbbed9028ac75a7595debd01f208999.webm?t=1788077945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/3cbbed9028ac75a7595debd01f208999.mp4?t=1788077945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of enemy cats and defend yourself by building increasingly crazy defense towers, all operated by strong-willed dogs! Be strategic in your placement, or you’ll quickly be overwhelmed by the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your money wisely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013110/extras/8191e716b61001f7513640f2e7219013.poster.avif?t=1788077945\" width=1170 height